screen.CLOUD_PHYSICS_SETTINGS=云层生成物理
screen.CLOUD_PHYSICS_SETTINGS.comment=云层由空气状态而非噪声生成：温度、湿度、稳定度和时段决定云在何处生成、生成何种类型以及高度。
option.VC_PHYSICS=§b云层生成物理
option.VC_PHYSICS.comment=云层由空气状态而非随机场生成。§e[*]§r 每个位置都有一列空气——其温度、湿度、随高度的冷却速率、是否有高压盖顶——云层由此产生：太阳加热产生热气流处形成积云，温暖午后云底抬升，高压逆温下形成层积云，潮湿清晨形成低层云，高空湿润处形成卷云。§e[*]§r 积云在上午生长、午后达到峰值、日落时消散。§e[*]§r 驱动积云、层积云和层云，在§a云属：全部§r下也会驱动高云。
value.VC_PHYSICS.0=关
value.VC_PHYSICS.1=开
option.VC_PH_DAY_COV_MIN=日云量下限
option.VC_PH_DAY_COV_MIN.comment=每晚会在此值与最大值之间随机抽取次日的云量，并在夜间平缓过渡。它在物理模式开启时替代§aCoverage§r，单位相同。
option.VC_PH_DAY_COV_MAX=日云量上限
option.VC_PH_DAY_COV_MAX.comment=该范围的上限。
option.VC_PH_DAY_HUM=日湿度变化
option.VC_PH_DAY_HUM.comment=某一天相对于另一天干燥或潮湿程度的百分比。§e[*]§r 潮湿的日子会带来层云和阴天的夜晚；干燥的日子则保持晴朗。
option.VC_PH_LIFT=低压抬升
option.VC_PH_LIFT.comment=低压系统昼夜抬升空气的强度，百分比。§e[*]§r 正是它维持积云发展，并在太阳无法产生热气流的夜间带来灰色层云。
option.VC_PH_SMOOTH=过渡时间
option.VC_PH_SMOOTH.comment=云层跟随条件变化所需的秒数。§e[*]§r 当空气不再生成云时——如日出时、高压移入时——云层会在约三倍于此的时间内逐渐变薄消散，新云亦以同样方式生成。不会瞬间出现或消失。
option.VC_PH_T_MEAN=平均温度
option.VC_PH_T_MEAN.comment=平均地表温度，§a°C§r。空气越暖，云底越高。
option.VC_PH_T_DAY=昼夜温差
option.VC_PH_T_DAY.comment=温度在平均值上下昼升夜降的幅度，单位为°C。§e[*]§r 温差大时，午后云底抬升很高，黎明时则降至地面。
option.VC_PH_T_VAR=温度变化
option.VC_PH_T_VAR.comment=一个气团与下一个气团之间的温度差异，单位为°C。
option.VC_PH_PEAK_HOUR=最暖时刻
option.VC_PH_PEAK_HOUR.comment=一天中地表最暖的时刻。现实中通常在正午过后两到三小时达到峰值。
option.VC_PH_HUMIDITY=湿度
option.VC_PH_HUMIDITY.comment=平均温度下的地表相对湿度，百分比。§e[*]§r 最关键的影响因素：干燥空气带来高而分散的积云或晴空；潮湿空气则带来低云底、更多云量、层积云和清晨层云。
option.VC_PH_HUM_VAR=湿度变化
option.VC_PH_HUM_VAR.comment=气团之间的湿度差异，百分比。
option.VC_PH_SYNOPTIC_HUM=气压湿度
option.VC_PH_SYNOPTIC_HUM.comment=低压更湿、高压更干的程度，百分比——因此天气系统自带其天空状况。
option.VC_PH_FOG=清晨层云
option.VC_PH_FOG.comment=空气近饱和且静稳时形成的低层云——多见于潮湿的夜晚和黎明。随白天气温升高而消散。
value.VC_PH_FOG.0=关
value.VC_PH_FOG.1=开
option.VC_PH_UPPER_HUM=高空湿度
option.VC_PH_UPPER_HUM.comment=卷云高度处的湿度，百分比。湿度越高，卷云越多，并会增厚为卷层云。深厚的风暴也会自行产生卷云。
option.VC_PH_UPPER_VAR=高空湿度变化
option.VC_PH_UPPER_VAR.comment=高空湿度在不同地点之间的变化幅度，百分比。
option.VC_PH_LAPSE=直减率
option.VC_PH_LAPSE.comment=空气随高度冷却的速率，单位为0.1度/千米——§a65§r为标准大气。§e[*]§r 数值越高越不稳定：云层发展得更高；数值越低越稳定：云层扁平浅薄。
option.VC_PH_LAPSE_VAR=直减率变化
option.VC_PH_LAPSE_VAR.comment=气团之间稳定度的差异，单位为0.1度/千米。
option.VC_PH_THERMAL=Thermal Strength
option.VC_PH_THERMAL.comment=How much warmer than the air a sunlit thermal starts, in tenths of a degree. §e[*]§r Stronger thermals start cumulus earlier in the morning and keep it later into the evening.
option.VC_PH_ENTRAIN=Entrainment
option.VC_PH_ENTRAIN.comment=How much mixing with drier air slows a rising cloud, tenths of a degree per km. Less lets clouds tower; more keeps them small.
option.VC_PH_INVERSION=Inversion Strength
option.VC_PH_INVERSION.comment=How strongly a high's warm lid stops rising air, per cent. §e[*]§r Strong: cumulus flattens against it and spreads into stratocumulus. Zero: no lid anywhere.
option.VC_PH_INV_HEIGHT=Inversion Height
option.VC_PH_INV_HEIGHT.comment=How high that lid sits, in metres.
option.VC_PH_MAX_DEPTH=Max Cloud Depth
option.VC_PH_MAX_DEPTH.comment=The tallest a cloud may grow, in tenths of a km.
option.VC_PH_COVER_GAIN=云量
option.VC_PH_COVER_GAIN.comment=How much of the sky the conditions turn into cloud, per cent.
option.VC_PH_KM_BASE=Deck Bottom Altitude
option.VC_PH_KM_BASE.comment=The real altitude the bottom of the cloud layer stands for, tenths of a km. §e[*]§r Together with the top, this is how real heights are laid over the layer you set in §aThickness§r.
option.VC_PH_KM_TOP=Deck Top Altitude
option.VC_PH_KM_TOP.comment=The real altitude the top of the cloud layer stands for, tenths of a km.
option.VC_PH_FIELD_FREQ=Air Mass Size
option.VC_PH_FIELD_FREQ.comment=How many air masses fit across the weather area: higher is smaller and more varied weather.
screen.BEACON_GLOW_SETTINGS=Beacon Glow
screen.BEACON_GLOW_SETTINGS.comment=Beacon beams lighting the volumetric clouds they pass through.
screen.BETTER_THUNDER_SETTINGS=更佳雷暴
screen.BETTER_THUNDER_SETTINGS.comment=Thunderstorms: the storm darkness, the flash of each strike, the colour of lightning, and the lightning inside the volumetric clouds.
screen.WEATHER_SETTINGS.comment=与天气条件相关的设置

screen.LEAVES_PHYSICS_SETTINGS=树叶物理效果
screen.LEAVES_PHYSICS_SETTINGS.comment=在草、高草和树叶常规风力摆动基础上增加额外运动效果：避开附近移动实体弯曲，雨天和雷暴时产生更强阵风。

screen.COLOR_CORRECTION_SETTINGS=颜色校正
screen.COLOR_CORRECTION_SETTINGS.comment=Everything that decides the final colour of the image: which tonemapper squeezes the scene onto your screen, exposure and white balance before it, colour grading after it, night vision, and the light and atmosphere colour multipliers.







