screen.TONEMAP_SETTINGS=Tonemapper Settings
screen.TONEMAP_SETTINGS.comment=The knobs of each tonemapper, one page per curve. §e[*]§r Only the page of the tonemapper you have selected does anything; the rest wait until you switch to theirs.

screen.COLORGRADING_SETTINGS=通道混合器
screen.COLORGRADING_SETTINGS.comment=Mixes the red, green and blue channels into each other, before the tonemapper.

screen.WORLD_BLUR_SETTINGS=世界模糊
screen.WORLD_BLUR_SETTINGS.comment=与华丽世界模糊效果相关的设置

