option.CLOUD_QUALITY=云层质量
option.CLOUD_QUALITY.comment=Adjusts the lighting, detail, and sample quality of the Reimagined, Unbound, Unbound+ and Realistic cloud styles. §e[*]§r Realistic: §cHigh§r is the full quality, a fine march that adapts its step to the cloud. Below it the clouds are rendered for a quarter of the pixels (Potato: a sixteenth) and rebuilt over a few frames, and each cloud layer is crossed in a fixed number of steps with a lighter light march, the way lightweight packs do it: §eMedium§r 20 steps and 4 light samples, §aLow§r 16 steps and 3 light samples, Potato 12 steps and 2. Much faster; the weather map is the same at every level. §e[*]§r Potato: the cheapest setting for every style, for the most FPS. §e[*]§r Does nothing with the "Vanilla" Cloud Style.
