screen.GODRAY_SETTINGS=丁达尔光效
screen.GODRAY_SETTINGS.comment=光束自身的基础效果及其控制参数。
option.GODRAYS=丁达尔光效
option.GODRAYS.comment=Gives the sun's light shafts a floor of their own, so they survive whatever §bLight Shaft Mode§r decides about haze. §e[*]§r Shafts and volumetric haze are the same term in this pack, which is why the Mode setting trades them against each other: §bExtreme§r keeps the shafts and fills the distance with milk, §bScene Aware§r clears the distance and takes the shafts with it. §e[*]§r This splits them: the shafts are the forward-scattered part, so they can be lifted only towards the light while the haze away from it is left exactly as the Mode set it.
value.GODRAYS.0=§cOFF
value.GODRAYS.1=§aON
option.GODRAY_INDEPENDENT=忽略光束模式
option.GODRAY_INDEPENDENT.comment=ON: the shafts hold their own strength no matter what §bLight Shaft Mode§r is doing. This is the setting that brings them back under §bScene Aware§r. §e[*]§r OFF: they still scale with the Mode's decision and only get their shape from the settings below -- useful if you want them to fade out indoors along with the haze.
value.GODRAY_INDEPENDENT.0=§cOFF
value.GODRAY_INDEPENDENT.1=§aON
option.GODRAY_INTENSITY=丁达尔效应强度
option.GODRAY_INTENSITY.comment=How strong the shafts are looking straight at the light. §e[*]§r 100 is full strength, the same as §bExtreme§r would give in that direction -- but only in that direction.
option.GODRAY_FOCUS=神光聚焦度
option.GODRAY_FOCUS.comment=光束贴合光源的紧密程度。[*] 这是前向散射项的指数：低数值使效果扩散至大部分天空并开始像雾气，高数值使其集中在太阳周围的窄锥形区域。[*] 数值4在偏离太阳45度时强度降至约四分之一。
option.GODRAY_DAY_I=神光：日间
option.GODRAY_DAY_I.comment=太阳升起时的光束强度，基于神光强度进行缩放。
option.GODRAY_NIGHT_I=神光：夜间
option.GODRAY_NIGHT_I.comment=夜间月光周围的光束强度，基于神光强度进行缩放。
option.GODRAY_RAIN_I=神光：雨天
option.GODRAY_RAIN_I.comment=雨天的光束强度，与天气效果混合。真实空气此时饱含水汽，因此超过100的数值在此场景下是合理的。
option.GODRAY_HORIZON_BOOST=低角度太阳增强
option.GODRAY_HORIZON_BOOST.comment=太阳接近地平线时的额外强度，随太阳升高逐渐消失。[*] 真实光束在太阳角度较低时最长，因为光线是斜掠场景而非垂直穿透。
option.LIGHTSHAFT_BEHAVIOUR=光轴模式
option.LIGHTSHAFT_BEHAVIOUR.comment=决定光轴的行为。[+] 场景感知光轴会在常规与极端模式间自动转换以提供最佳效果。[-] 极端模式不建议用于常规游戏，可能会严重影响性能。
value.LIGHTSHAFT_BEHAVIOUR.0=§cOFF
value.LIGHTSHAFT_BEHAVIOUR.1=场景感知 [+]
value.LIGHTSHAFT_BEHAVIOUR.2=常规
value.LIGHTSHAFT_BEHAVIOUR.3=极端 [-]

option.LIGHTSHAFT_SMOKE=光轴烟雾
