option.TM_EXPOSURE=整体亮度
option.TM_EXPOSURE.comment=Multiplies the light of the whole scene before it is tonemapped - the exposure of the camera. §e[*]§r With Auto Exposure on, this is added on top of it.




option.T_SATURATION=饱和度
option.T_SATURATION.comment=Adjusts overall colorfulness of the image. §e[*]§r §cOnly used by the Original tonemapper.§r §e[*]§r For every tonemapper, use Color Grading > Saturation.

option.T_VIBRANCE=浅色饱和度
option.T_VIBRANCE.comment=Also known as "Vibrance". Adjusts the colorfulness of the image, but already colorful pixels are less affected. §e[*]§r §cOnly used by the Original tonemapper.§r

option.COLORGRADING=§e色彩分级
option.COLORGRADING.comment=启用设置以自由混合最终颜色通道。
