option.LIGHT_DENOISE=§bLighting Denoiser
option.LIGHT_DENOISE.comment=Averages the two random terms in the block-lighting estimate instead of taking a single sample of each. §e[*]§r Block lighting is computed for one pixel in §bBlocklight Resolution§r squared, and two of its terms were one random draw per texel per frame: where along the cone the soft shadow starts marching, and which point on a light's disc the §bTranslucent Light Tint§r ray passes through. §e[*]§r That is the grain in the lighting, and the coloured speckle on surfaces lit through stained glass is the tint term specifically. §e[*]§r The cost lands only in the reduced-resolution pass, not per screen pixel. §e[*]§r OFF compiles back to exactly the old single-sample path.
value.LIGHT_DENOISE.0=§cOFF
value.LIGHT_DENOISE.1=§aON
screen.LIGHT_DENOISE_SETTINGS=光照降噪器设置
screen.LIGHT_DENOISE_SETTINGS.comment=每个噪点项的平均采样次数。
option.LIGHT_DENOISE_STABLE=稳定采样
option.LIGHT_DENOISE_STABLE.comment=每帧使用相同采样位置，而非绘制新的随机点。[*] 这正是防止噪点移动的关键。若每帧重绘，噪点会移动，且时间滤波器无法将其平均消除，因为历史数据会被钳制到局部颜色范围。[*] 折衷方案：固定采样会产生偏差，而随机采样仅为噪点，因此低采样数在半影中会表现为色带而非颗粒。若观察到此现象请提高以下数值。[*] 关闭则恢复旧版移动噪点特性，同时保留平均处理。
value.LIGHT_DENOISE_STABLE.0=§cOFF
value.LIGHT_DENOISE_STABLE.1=§aON
option.LIGHT_DENOISE_SHADOW_SAMPLES=柔阴影采样数
option.LIGHT_DENOISE_SHADOW_SAMPLES.comment=每光源柔阴影的锥体追踪采样数。[*] 采样在步进区间内分层而非独立绘制，因此两个此类采样值明显优于两个随机采样。[*] 1为旧行为。2可消除大部分颗粒；超过4后收效甚微。
option.LIGHT_DENOISE_TINT_SAMPLES=玻璃定色采样数
option.LIGHT_DENOISE_TINT_SAMPLES.comment=每光源穿过光源面积的透射定色光线数。[*] 仅在开启透射光源着色时生效。若通过彩色玻璃的光线呈现斑点状，请提高此值；这是导致彩色噪点的单一因素。[*] 1为旧行为。
option.BLOCKLIGHT_RESOLUTION=方块光照分辨率
option.BLOCKLIGHT_RESOLUTION.comment=更改方块光照渲染的内部分辨率。[*]较低的值更有利于性能。
value.BLOCKLIGHT_RESOLUTION.1= 1
value.BLOCKLIGHT_RESOLUTION.2=0.5
value.BLOCKLIGHT_RESOLUTION.3=0.33
value.BLOCKLIGHT_RESOLUTION.4=0.25
value.BLOCKLIGHT_RESOLUTION.6=0.17
value.BLOCKLIGHT_RESOLUTION.8=0.13
value.BLOCKLIGHT_RESOLUTION.10=0.1

option.BLOCKLIGHT_HIGHLIGHT=镜面方块光照高光
