option.GI_DEBUG=全局光照调试视图
option.GI_DEBUG.comment=Replaces the scene with the irradiance cache itself, to tell a fault in the cache apart from a fault in what reads it. §e[*]§r Everything after the cache mixes it with sky ambient, block light and shadow, and any of those can make steady data look like it is flickering. §e[*]§r §oCache§r is the raw bounce. §oHue§r takes the brightness out, so a wobble goes flat and a position error does not. §oVs Ambient§r shows how far the bounce is from the ambient it competes with - where it is dark, the bounce is being thrown away.
