option.ANAMORPHIC_TINT_R=光晕色调 红
option.ANAMORPHIC_TINT_R.comment=Red channel of the anamorphic streak tint. §e[*]§r Only used when Anamorphic Flares is set to §aAnamorphic Blue§r.
option.ANAMORPHIC_TINT_G=光晕色调 绿
option.ANAMORPHIC_TINT_G.comment=Green channel of the anamorphic streak tint. §e[*]§r Only used when Anamorphic Flares is set to §aAnamorphic Blue§r.
option.ANAMORPHIC_TINT_B=光晕色调 蓝
option.ANAMORPHIC_TINT_B.comment=Blue channel of the anamorphic streak tint. §e[*]§r Only used when Anamorphic Flares is set to §aAnamorphic Blue§r.

screen.HEAT_WAVE_SETTINGS=热浪扭曲设置
screen.HEAT_WAVE_SETTINGS.comment=上升的热空气使图像弯曲。
option.HEAT_DISTORTION=热浪扭曲
option.HEAT_DISTORTION.comment=火焰、岩浆及发热方块上升的热空气会使其上方的图像弯曲，可在炎热群系中启用持续微光效果。[*] 热源通过屏幕空间中明亮、暖色调像素检测，因此隐藏在几何体后的热源不会产生微光，而强橙色方块偶尔会被误判。调整热源灵敏度以减少误报。[*] 默认关闭。
value.HEAT_DISTORTION.0=关
value.HEAT_DISTORTION.1=开
