option.PP_FILTER_LOOK.comment=Which look to apply. §e[*]§r §bReversal and negative§r: Warm Chrome, Vivid Slide, Portrait Negative, Consumer Negative, Tungsten Night, Expired Film, Instant Print. §e[*]§r §bLab processes§r: Bleach Bypass, Cross Process, Three-Strip, Sepia, Cyanotype, Selenium Tone. §e[*]§r §bMonochrome§r: Black and White, Orthochromatic, Red Filter Mono, Infrared, Noir. §e[*]§r §bGrades§r: Day for Night, Faded Print, Teal and Orange, Golden Hour, Cold Morning, Sunset Push, City Night (teal blacks, cream lights - made for night skylines). §e[*]§r Pair any of them with Strength -- most are far more usable at a third than at full.
